problem.statementMd:
A tile artist builds a pyramid of numbered tiles, one row at a time:

- the top row is a single tile `1`;
- every row starts and ends with `1`;
- every other tile is the **sum of the two tiles diagonally above it**.

Return the first `rows` rows of the pyramid.

